{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_HWTESTMANAGEMENTINTEGRATIONGUIDE_SECTION_12_Integration_requirements_in_AUTOSAR_SW_architecture","src":"manifest","doc":"HWTestManagementIntegrationGuide","page":11,"text":"12 Integration requirements in AUTOSAR SW architecture\nThis section describes the fundamental requirements that need to be implemented in\nthe affected standard AUTOSAR modules, in order to integrate the HTMSS module\nand the corresponding Microcontroller Specific Test Package in the AUTOSAR\narchitecture.\nThe following AUTOSAR modules are affected in this context:\n\nECU State Manager – Extension of EcuM UP and DOWN phase\n\nBSW Mode Manager – Extension of shutdown target\n\nMCU driver – Extension of reset reason","caption":"12 Integration requirements in AUTOSAR SW architecture","sha":null,"series":[{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_HWTESTMANAGEMENTINTEGRATIONGUIDE_SECTION_12_Integration_requirements_in_AUTOSAR_SW_architecture","releases":["4.3.1"],"page":11,"hash":"16469a84d55e894c","caption":"","screenshot_path":"_src/spec/snippets/assets/122266d7427f/page_11.webp"},{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_HWTESTMANAGEMENTINTEGRATIONGUIDE_SECTION_12_Integration_requirements_in_AUTOSAR_SW_architecture","releases":["R19-11"],"page":11,"hash":"8db413e6aecfeb34","caption":"","screenshot_path":"_src/spec/snippets/assets/9682a50294eb/page_11.webp"},{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_HWTESTMANAGEMENTINTEGRATIONGUIDE_SECTION_12_Integration_requirements_in_AUTOSAR_SW_architecture","releases":["R20-11"],"page":11,"hash":"282959d76b4f9bbc","caption":"","screenshot_path":"_src/spec/snippets/assets/cceab3d3479d/page_11.webp"},{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_HWTESTMANAGEMENTINTEGRATIONGUIDE_SECTION_12_Integration_requirements_in_AUTOSAR_SW_architecture","releases":["R21-11","R22-11"],"page":11,"hash":"8db413e6aecfeb34","caption":"","screenshot_path":"_src/spec/snippets/assets/a5d843545ca2/page_11.webp"}],"releases":["R19-11","R20-11","R21-11","R22-11","4.3.1"],"screenshot_path":"_src/spec/snippets/assets/a5d843545ca2/page_11.webp","trel":"R22